#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:249
msgid "Check if the DTEP can act as a top level DTEP."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn sik dat DTBP op de böverste Evene bruken lett."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, topLevel)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:252
msgid "Check if the DTEP can act as a top level DTEP. This means that the document can be of this type. Some pseudo DTEPs cannot act as a top level DTEP, like <i>PHP</i> as they are always included as part of another DTEP, while some others can be included and act as standalone as well, like the case of <i>CSS</i>."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn sik dat Dokmenttyp-Bewrkpaket (DTBP) op de böverste Evene bruken lett. Dat bedüüdt, dat Dokment kann vun dissen Typ wesen. En poor Pseudo-DTBPs laat sik nich op de böverste Evene bruken, so as <i>PHP</i>. Se warrt jümmers as Deel vun en anner DTBP inslaten. En poor anner laat sik man ok alleen bruken, so as <i>CSS</i>."

