"<p><b>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;SpecialAreas=&lt;?xml ?&gt;, &lt;!-- --&gt;, &lt;! &gt;\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;SpecialAreaNames = XML PI, comment, DTD\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;Comments = &lt;!-- --&gt;\n"
"</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du allgemeen Inleesregeln anhangen wullt. Dat sünd:\n"
"<p><b>\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;SpecialAreas=&lt;?xml ?&gt;, &lt;!-- --&gt;, &lt;! &gt;\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;SpecialAreaNames = XML PI, comment, DTD\n"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;Comments = &lt;!-- --&gt;\n"
"</b></p>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, useCommonRules)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:927
msgid "Use common rules"
msgstr "Allgemeen Regeln bruken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, extendedBooleans)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:937
msgid "Check if the booleans are stored in extended form"
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn Du boolsch Weerten in verwiedert Form sekern wullt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, extendedBooleans)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:945
msgid ""
"Check if you want extended booleans in the language.<br>"
"\n"
"Examples:<br>"
"\n"
"<i>Simple boolean</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr&gt;</b><br>"
"\n"
"<i>Extended boolean</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"1\"&gt;</b> or <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"true\"&gt;</b>.\n"
"<br>"
"\n"
"See the <b>True</b> and <b>False</b> boxes to define the values for true and false."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du boolsch Weerten in verwiedert Form sekern wullt.<br>"
"\n"
"Bispelen:<br>"
"\n"
"<i>Eenfach boolsch Weert</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr&gt;</b><br>"
"\n"
"<i>Verwiedert boolsch Weert</i>: <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"1\"&gt;</b> oder <b>&lt;tag&nbsp;booleanAttr=\"true\"&gt;</b>.\n"
"<br>"
"\n"
"Mit de Feller <b>True</b> un <b>False</b> laat sik de Weerten för \"wohr\" un \"falsch\" fastleggen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, extendedBooleans)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:948
msgid "Extended booleans"
msgstr "Verwiedert boolsch Weerten"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, falseEdit)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, trueEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:966
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:984
msgid "The value of \"true\" in case of extended booleans"
msgstr "De Weert för \"wohr\" bi Bruuk vun verwiedert boolsch Weerten"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel39)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:994
msgid "False:"
msgstr "Falsch:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel38)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1007
msgid "True:"
msgstr "Wohr:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, specialAreasEdit)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel27)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1033
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1045
msgid "Comma-separated list of the beginning and closing string for special areas"
msgstr "Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Anfang- un Afsluutbetekers för besünner Rebeden"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, specialAreasEdit)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel27)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1038
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1050
msgid ""
"The beginning and closing string of special areas, separated by a comma.<br>"
"\n"
" Special areas are not parsed according to this DTD's rules, but according to their own rules.<br>"
"\n"
"    A special area can be a pseudo DTD, a comment or something like that, for example <i>&lt;!--&nbsp;--&gt;</i>."
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas optrennt List vun Anfang- un Afsluttbetekers för besünner Rebeden.<br>"
"\n"
" Besünner Rebeden warrt nich na de Regeln vun disse DTD inleest, sünnern na ehr egen Regeln.<br>"
"\n"
"    En besünner Rebeet kann en Pseudo-DTD wesen, en Kommentar oder so wat in de Oort wesen, t.B. <i>&lt;!--&nbsp;--&gt;</i>."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel27)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1053
msgid "Special areas:"
msgstr "Besünner Rebeden:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, specialAreaNamesEdit)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel28)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1063
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1070
msgid "Comma-separated list of the names for the above-defined special areas"
msgstr "Mit Kommas optrennt List vun Naams för de baven fastleggt besünner Rebeden"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel28)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1073
msgid "Special area names:"
msgstr "Besünner Rebeetnaams:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, specialTagsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1083
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1097
msgid "Specifies a tag that defines the start of a special area"
msgstr "Leggt en Beteker as Anfang vun en besünner Rebeet fast"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, specialTagsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1087
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1101
msgid ""
"Specifies a tag which defines the start of a special area in the form of <i>tagname(attributename)</i>.<br>"
"\n"
"Example:<b>script(language)</b> means that any <b>&lt;script&gt;</b> tag having a <b>language</b> attribute indicates a special area."
msgstr ""
"Leggt en Beteker as Anfang vun en besünner Rebeet na de Schriefwies <i>Betekernaam(Attributnaam)</i>fast.<br>"
"\n"
"Bispill:<b>skript(spraak)</b> bedüüdt, dat elk <b>&lt;script&gt;</b>-Beteker, de en <b>spraak</b>-Attribut bargt, en besünner Rebeet fastleggt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel40)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1090
msgid "Special tags:"
msgstr "Besünner Betekers:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1118
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1239
msgid "Tags and attributes defining this DTEP"
msgstr "Betekers un Attributen, de dit DTBP fastleggt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, definitionTagsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1125
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1246
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of tags that define this DTEP. The format used is <i>tagname(attribute[defaultvalue])</i>. If the parent (a real) DTEP has a tag with <i>tagname</i> and\n"
"the <i>attribute value</i> of this tag is equal with the name of this DTEP, the tag area\n"
"is parsed according to the rules of this DTEP.<br>"
"\n"
"If <i>[defaultvalue]</i> is present, it means that if the attribute is not present in the tag it is taken as present with <i>value = defaultvalue</i>.<br>"
"\n"
"Example: <b>Tags=style(type[text/css])</b> means that both <b>&lt;style&gt;</b> and <b>&lt;style&nbsp;type=\"text/css\"&gt;</b> are treated the same way and the DTEP defined by this tag is named <b>text/css</b>."
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Betekers, de dit Dokmenttyp-Bewerkpaket (DTBP) fastleggt. As Formaat warrt <i>Betekernaam(Attribut[Standardweert])</i> bruukt. Wenn de överornt (un rejell) DTBP en Beteker mit <i>Betekernaam</i> bargt un\n"
"dissen Beteker sien <i>Attributweert</i> liek mit den Naam vun dit DTBP is, warrt dat Beteker-Rebeet\n"
"na de Regeln vun dit DTBP inleest.<br>"
"\n"
"Is en <i>[Standardweert]</i> angeven, warrt de Betekers mit en fehlen Attribut so bruukt, as stunn dat Attribut mit <i>Weert = Standardweert</i> dor binnen.<br>"
"\n"
"Bispill: <b>Betekers=style(type[text/css])</b> bedüüdt, dat <b>&lt;style&gt;</b> un <b>&lt;style&nbsp;type=\"text/css\"&gt;</b> liek behannelt warrt un dat DTBP, dat mit dissen Beteker fastleggt warrt, <b>text/css</b> heet."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel21)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1128
msgid "Definition tags:"
msgstr "Definitschoon-Betekers:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel20)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, areaBordersEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1138
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1253
msgid "Comma-separated list of the area borders"
msgstr "Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Rebeetgrenzen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel20)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, areaBordersEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1142
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of the area borders encapsulating this pseudo DTEP. In the case of PHP it is:<br>"
"\n"
"<b>&lt;?&nbsp;?&gt;,&nbsp;&lt;*&nbsp;*&gt;,&nbsp;&lt;%&nbsp;%&gt;</b>"
msgstr ""
"Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Rebeetgrenzen, de dit Pseudo-DTBP insluten. Bi PHP is dat:<br>"
"\n"
"<b>&lt;?&nbsp;?&gt;,&nbsp;&lt;*&nbsp;*&gt;,&nbsp;&lt;%&nbsp;%&gt;</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel20)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1145
msgid "Area borders:"
msgstr "Rebeetgrenzen:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel22)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, structKeywordsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1155
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1229
msgid "Comma-separated list of structure keywords"
msgstr "Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Struktuur-Slötelwöör"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel22)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, structKeywordsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1158
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1232
msgid "Comma-separated list of structure keywords. The keywords used here are used to create new node (nodes for structures) in the structure tree, like for a function, class or if block."
msgstr "Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Struktuur-Slötelwöör. Disse Slötelwöör warrt hier för't Opstellen vun en nieg Knütt (Struktuurknütten) binnen den Struktuurboom bruukt, a.B. för en Funkschoon, Klass oder \"IF\"-Block."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel22)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1161
msgid "Structure keywords:"
msgstr "Struktuur-Slötelwöör:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel26)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, structRxEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1171
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1374
msgid "Regular expression that finds the beginning or end of a structure"
msgstr "Reguleer Utdruck, de Anfang un Enn vun en Struktuur söcht"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel26)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, structRxEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1174
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1377
msgid "Regular expression that finds the beginning or end of a structure. This is usually the combination of <b>Structure beginning</b> and <b>Structure end</b>, like <b>\\\\{&nbsp;|&nbsp;\\\\}</b>"
msgstr "Reguleer Utdruck, de Anfang un Enn vun en Struktuur söcht. Dit is normalerwies en Mischen ut <b>Struktuuranfang</b> un <b>Strukturenn</b>, liek <b>\\\\{&nbsp;|&nbsp;\\\\}</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel26)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1177
msgid "Structure delimiting:"
msgstr "Struktuur-Grenz:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel24)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, structBeginEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1187
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1290
msgid "A string specifying the beginning of a structure"
msgstr "En Tekenkeed, de den Anfang vun en Struktuur angifft"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel24)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, structBeginEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1190
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1293
msgid "A string specifying the beginning of a structure, like <b>{</b> in many cases."
msgstr "En Tekenkeed, de den Anfang vun en Struktuur angifft, liek faken <b>{</b>."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel24)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1193
msgid "Structure beginning:"
msgstr "Struktuur-Anfang:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel23)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, localStructKeywordsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1203
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1219
msgid "Comma-separated list of the local scope defining keywords"
msgstr "Mit Kommas optrennt List vun Slötelwöör, de dat lokale Rebeet fastleggt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel23)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, localStructKeywordsEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1206
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1222
msgid "Comma-separated list of the local scope defining keywords. Other structure group elements found under a structure node that was created based on a keyword from this list are treated as local elements. For example if this list contains <b>function</b>, it means that elements, like variables found under a <b>function</b> are local, relative to the node that holds the <b>function</b>."
msgstr "Mit Kommas optrennt List vun Slötelwöör, de dat lokale Rebeet fastleggt. Anner Struktuurkoppelelementen warrt as lokaal Elementen behannelt, wenn se nerrn en Struktuurknütt liggt, dat op en Slötelwoort vun disse List baseert opstellt wöör. Wenn disse List a.B. <b>Funkschoon</b> bargt, bedüüdt dat, dat Elementen, liek Variabeln, de nerrn <b>Funkschoon</b> funnen warrt, relativ to den Knütt, de de <b>Funkschoon</b> bargt, lokaal sünd."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel23)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1209
msgid "Local scope keywords:"
msgstr "Lokaalrebeet-Slötelwöör:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, structEndEdit)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel25)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1264
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1274
msgid "A string specifying the end of a structure"
msgstr "En Tekenkeed, de dat Enn vun en Struktuur angifft"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, structEndEdit)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel25)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1267
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1277
msgid "A string specifying the end of a structure, like <b>}</b> in many cases."
msgstr "En Tekenkeed, de dat Enn vun en Struktuur angifft, liek faken <b>}</b>."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel25)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1280
msgid "Structure end:"
msgstr "Struktuur-Enn:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel19)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, membersAfterEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1308
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1358
msgid "Regular expression to find out when to invoke member autocompletion"
msgstr "Reguleer Utdruck för't Rutfinnen, wannehr automaatsch Matenkompletteren opropen warrn schall"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel19)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, membersAfterEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1317
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1367
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find out when to invoke member autocompletion. <br>"
"\n"
"Example:<br>"
"\n"
"- we have a class called <b>foo</b> with some member variables<br>"
"\n"
"- the object of type <b>foo</b> is used in the document as $<b>objFoo</b><br>"
"\n"
"- the members can appear as <b>$objFoo->member</b> or <b>$objFoo.member</b>\n"
"- in the above case this entry should look like <b>(?:-&gt;|\\.)$</b> (autocomplete if the object is followed by <b>-&gt;</b> or <b>.</b>)<br>"
"\n"
"    The regular expression must be terminated with <b>$</b> (match end of line)."
msgstr ""
"Reguleer Utdruck för't Rutfinnen, wannehr automaatsch Matenkompletteren opropen warrn schall.<br>"
"\n"
"Bispill: <br>"
"\n"
"- Wi hebbt en Klass mit den Naam <b>foo</b> mit en poor Matenvariabeln.<br>"
"\n"
"- Dat Objekt vun den Typ <b>foo</b> warrt binnen dat Dokment as $<b>objFoo</b> bruukt.<br>"
"\n"
"- De Maten köönt as <b>$objFoo->Liddmaat</b> oder as <b>$objFoo.Liddmaat</b> vörkamen\n"
"- in den Fall baven schull disse Indrag liek <b>(?:-&gt;|\\.)$</b> utsehn. (automaatsch Kompletteren, wenn na dat Objekt en <b>-&gt;</b> oder <b>.</b> kummt)<br>"
"\n"
"    De reguleer Utdruck mutt mit <b>$</b> (Reeg-Enn) afslaten wesen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel19)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1320
msgid "Complete class members after:"
msgstr "Klass-Liddmaten kompletteren na:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel18)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, attributesAfterEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1338
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1351
msgid "Autocomplete attributes after this character. See the information for the same entry valid for tags."
msgstr "Attributen na dit Teken automaatsch Kompletteren. Kiek Di de Informatschonen över den sülven Indrag för Betekers an."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel18)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1341
msgid "Complete attributes after:"
msgstr "Attributen kompletteren na:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel15)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, attributeSeparatorEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1391
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1488
msgid "The character specifying the end of an attribute"
msgstr "Dat Teken, dat dat Enn vun en Attribut fastleggt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel15)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, attributeSeparatorEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1394
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1491
msgid "The character specifying the end of an attribute. By default it is <b>\"</b> for XML DTEPs and <b>,</b> for pseudo DTEPs."
msgstr "Dat Teken, dat dat Enn vun en Attribut angifft. Standard is <b>\"</b> för XML-DTBPs (Dokmenttyp-Bewerkpaketen) un <b>,</b> för Pseudo-DTBPs."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel15)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1397
msgid "Attribute separator:"
msgstr "Attribut-Trenner:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel17)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, mayContainEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1418
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1498
msgid "Comma-separated list of DTEPs that can be present inside this DTEP"
msgstr "Mit Kommas scheedt List vun DTBPs, de binnen dit DTBP vörkamen köönt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel17)
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, mayContainEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1421
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1501
msgid "Comma-separated list of DTEPs that can be present inside this DTEP. The list consist usually of pseudo DTEPs."
msgstr "Mit Kommas scheedt List vun Dokmenttyp-Bewerkpaketen (DTBPs), de binnen dit DTBP vörkamen köönt. De List bargt normalerwies Pseudo-DTBPs."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel17)
#. +> trunk
#: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1424
msgid "Included DTEPs:"
